      "text": "用短线段近似弧长。",
      "latex": "\\Delta s\\approx\\|\\mathbf r\\prime(t)\\|\\Delta t"
    },
    {
      "text": "每段累积密度乘长度。",
      "latex": "\\Delta m\\approx f(\\mathbf r(t))\\Delta s"
    },
    {
      "text": "加总并取网格极限。",
      "latex": "\\int_Cf\\,ds=\\int_a^b f(\\mathbf r(t))\\|\\mathbf r\\prime(t)\\|dt"
    }
